WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.400
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.400
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.280
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.280
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:22.080
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:22.080
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:27.250
The precious arms

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:27.250
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.260
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.260
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.600
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.600
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:49.070
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:49.070
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:56.320
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:56.320
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:04.250
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:04.250
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.540
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.540
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.210
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.210
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:19.390
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:19.390
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.730
This love...

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.730
Omoi wo

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.370
Dad...

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.540
What was that building for?

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.540
What is the GPO trying to do with Rynax?

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:54.880
There are people I want you to meet
at the place we're going to now.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:04.350
Here Right Now

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.320
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.450
Well, I guess a little.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:25.830
You're a former GPO officer, yet you get in our way,

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.660
and on top of that, you get arrested.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.420
I thought for sure I could get away.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.210
Where are Kurau and the others?

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.220
That's something I can't tell even to you.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.590
Do you really know where they are?

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.220
I guess I couldn't tell you if I didn't know, huh?

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.770
What do you know about those two?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.850
What do YOU know?

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.900
What do you know?

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.570
I'm so glad you're here, Dr. Amami.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.780
We've been so worried.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:05.870
Thank you.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.210
I wanted to come earlier, but I was under strict supervision.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.590
These are my daughters.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.800
N-Nice to meet you.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.020
This way, Dr. Amami.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.400
What's the matter, Kurau?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.780
I feel something...

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.610
Who is it?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.960
Director!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.290
This is Dr. Amami and his daughters.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.380
We've been waiting for you.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.260
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.840
This way, please.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.420
Yes.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.510
Kurau...

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:07.890
Rynax.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.810
Yes... it's faint but I can feel it.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.320
At first it was only my fingertips,

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.530
but gradually the glow to spread to my arm.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.450
Why?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.370
Why do I feel Rynax?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:41.380
Two years ago, there was an accident on the Moon.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.840
What is this reaction?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.340
What's going on?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:02.320
By the time we got there, it was already...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.200
We turned off the system and
Rynax stopped flowing out.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:12.540
But the damage spread until Rynax disappeared.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.000
We worked far from the system...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.290
But those who were close to it were...

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.300
I'm sorry...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.590
it's my fault that you had to go through this...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:32.930
We didn't ask you here to attack you.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:33.890
That's right.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:39.900
You helped us so much at
that facility we were locked up in.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.400
And you also protected us from the GPO.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.490
It's the GPO that cannot be forgiven.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.780
In order to hide the accident from the public,

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.580
the GPO would not even let us contact our families.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.950
After they made you leave us...

00:05:55.540 --> 00:06:00.420
the GPO treated us like some
experimental subjects...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.880
Our bodies may be like this,
but we're still humans!

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:15.640
I heard from Dr. Amami that those Ryna sapiens
you're after started out as victims themselves.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.480
At times, victims can turn into assailants.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.310
I feel bad for those who cannot move.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.940
But we must capture those who have escaped.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.450
It's not like all of them are committing crimes.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.280
They have dangerous powers.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:33.830
Powers like that cannot be left loose.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.450
Do you hate them?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:39.120
Those powers... Do you hate them?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.290
Ayaka?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.340
Dr. Amami...

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.510
All I can do is just watch over them.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.350
Please help us!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.640
Yes. That is why I came.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.520
I'll do whatever I can.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.900
I felt Rynax.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.320
But there weren't Rynax in any of them back there.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.860
Just footprints of Rynax.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.080
They're different from us.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.000
There's one more patient here
I'd like you to take a look at.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.350
How could the GPO leave her till she got like this?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.470
Kurau...

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:45.400
Rynax destroyed her body...

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.360
Destroyed it...

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:57.490
Oh, Sakamoto.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.370
Let me introduce you.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.750
This is Dr. Amami, whom I've told you about before.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.500
Dr. Amami?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.960
He arrived here this morning.
From the research facility.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.840
The developer of Rynax Energy?

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.050
It's your fault Midori looks like that!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:21.140
Stop that! Sakamoto!
The doctor is here to help us all.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.520
There's no way I'm letting this guy touch Midori!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.610
But... if we don't do something, Midori will...

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.610
Midori has me! I... I'm here for her.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.110
Sakamoto!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.200
He is...

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.160
Sakamoto is Midori's fiancé.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.790
For this to have happened to her
without his knowledge

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.550
makes him unable to trust anyone any more.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.010
Come in.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:01.930
Kurau...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.600
What about that girl?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.730
Christmas? She must've been tired.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.230
She fell asleep.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.860
I see...

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.190
You know, Dad...

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.530
What are you going to do for those people, Dad?

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:25.040
With the technology I have now,
I cannot undo what's been done.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.210
I can only stabilize their condition.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.920
After the accident two years ago,

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:37.130
I created a system that can suppress Rynax activity.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.470
Attractor Rynax System.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:45.520
But who knew that would end up hurting you?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.900
Dad...

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.070
I'll reduce the power output and use it on them.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:56.650
I just contacted someone who can 
help me inside the GPO.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.820
Let's wait to hear from him.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.290
Dad, I...

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.790
I think I can do it.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.710
I can cure those people.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.230
Try to remember...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.980
What I did... That time...

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.920
I can move it. It moves!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.550
I can move it! I got my feeling back!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.510
Kurau... You...

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.390
Kurau!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.890
Kurau...

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.650
Midori...

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.280
Look, it's the Earth.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.490
Remember how we used to look up
at the Moon all the time?

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.240
You always used to say,

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.540
"my dream is for us to look at the Earth
from the Moon together."

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.920
I was against you working on the Moon...

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.420
And we argued about it. Yeah, constantly...

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.260
Don't be upset any more, Midori.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.090
We're looking at the Earth together now.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.140
Okay?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.600
Dad...

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:55.060
Kurau, is it okay for you to get up now?

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.520
Yes... I'm fine now.

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.570
Really... I'm glad.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.360
Kurau, I'll go make some tea.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:12.330
One time, I sent another Rynax
back to its original world.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.090
I wasn't sure if I could do it or not. But...

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:16.960
I see...

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.670
If I did the same thing,

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.180
then I could probably return this body to you.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:25.800
Kurau...

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.020
Christmas is my Pair.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.650
Pair...

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.230
I've waited for her. For ten full years.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.360
If we use Christmas' powers,

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:46.240
then I can probably return this body to you.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.490
But...

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.500
But... I just don't know any more.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:58.130
As soon as I realized that, I just don't know...

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:01.090
If I go back to the Rynax world,

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.010
then what will happen to Christmas?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.340
Will Christmas be all alone here in this world?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.140
Kurau...

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:14.440
But... I have to return this body to you.
I promised you... But...

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.060
Kurau...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:20.650
But I can't leave Christmas alone... But...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:21.820
Kurau...

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.900
What am I supposed to do?

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.740
What should I do?

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.450
Kurau!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.240
Kurau...

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.420
Kurau... I'll find a way...

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.470
So that you two won't have to live apart...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.430
I will...

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.300
I'm sorry.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.430
I'm sorry, Dad!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.440
Listen, Kurau.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:02.110
How many times have I wished
I could go back to that day...

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.150
How many times...

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:11.780
But seeing you like this, as you are now, makes me happy.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.580
Dad...

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.410
So happy...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.250
Dad...

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.540
You've grown up, Kurau.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.550
Dad...

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.770
Christmas...

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.310
Kurau...

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.110
I didn't know you were here.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:41.980
Yeah.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.900
The Earth...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.950
We used to be there, right?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.450
Yeah...

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.160
We've sure come far, haven't we?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:54.620
Yeah...

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.830
Kurau, I'm glad Dad was safe.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:02.790
Yeah...

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.260
Christmas, I'm going to help Dad.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:13.800
I'm going to help the people here, and those
captured by the GPO, to return to normal.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.180
Kurau...

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:21.650
I've made up my mind!
To help Dad. To do all I can.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.610
Kurau! I want to help too.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.480
I want to help you too!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.590
I can't do it all at once.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:30.050
But she doesn't have much time.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.090
I'd better hurry...

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.550
What are you doing?!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.930
You're that girl from this afternoon...

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.100
Amami's daughter...

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.310
Get out of here!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.480
Just go!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.090
You're cured...

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.930
How did that happen?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.600
It's all thanks to Kurau!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.350
Kurau?

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.430
That's right!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:25.100
She a Rynax victim too.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.400
But she has a power much stronger than us.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.440
And she cured us!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.900
Midori can be cured too!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.320
Midori can be cured?!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:40.080
Please let me see her.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.330
I'll try my best.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:11.400
Let me wait a while, and then I'll continue.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.320
We're almost there.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:14.860
O-Okay...

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.330
Hajime Amami...

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.670
His daughter, Kurau Amami.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:35.090
Died ten years ago, but still lives.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.010
Inspector Wong knew this and...

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.180
What's wrong?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.060
Shingo Sakamoto?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.730
You mean Midori Nonaka's fiancé?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.730
Has been seen at the sanatorium?

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.520
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.570
Oh, wait!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.030
Any trace of Kurau?

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.820
I see... All right.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:03.740
Ryna sapien... Why did you run away?

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.660
Knowing you were risking death...

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.050
Shingo...

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:21.550
Shingo...

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:24.930
Midori...

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:28.770
Thank you, Shingo.
For making my dream come true.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.190
Dream?

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.810
To look at the Earth together.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:33.610
Midori...

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.570
Sorry for being so selfish.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.240
I know I made you worry.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.530
Midori!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.030
I'm glad I was able to talk to you one last time.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:46.030
Thank you, Shingo...

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:53.210
It can't be... No... No!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.750
I watched you all along, Shingo.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:59.340
I'm so happy you stayed with me...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.120
What happened?

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.580
She died.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.490
Died... What does that mean?

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.870
She's no longer with us...

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:32.870
Kurau!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.290
You must leave immediately!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.920
Take Christmas with you!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.960
We can't just leave by ourselves!
What about those people?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.840
They have us.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.090
Dad!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.970
I'm glad I saw you again.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.850
I will do what I must do.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:55.480
So you... You two... must live in this world.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.980
No matter what happens, please live!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.570
Dad...

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.030
Dad!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:06.200
I'll stay with Kurau. I'll protect her!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.620
And we'll come back one day!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:13.500
I'll be sure to bring Kurau
back to you one day. So...

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.540
Thank you... Christmas.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.960
Hurry! There's no time!

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.960
Come, hurry. This way!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.520
I'm sorry...

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.270
Kurau...

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.950
From a great distance

